OpenCV 5.0.0 companion source
=============================
Source: https://github.com/opencv/opencv/archive/refs/tags/5.0.0.tar.gz
SHA256: b0528f5a1d379d59d4701cb28c36e22214cc51cf64594e5b56f2d3e6c0233095

The build tool extracts opencv-5.0.0/ alongside howdy-next/, compiles selected
OpenCV modules, and bundles their private shared libraries in this package at
/usr/lib/howdy-next/. OpenCV is a separate source input, not a path within the
Howdy source tree. This declaration covers those bundled libraries.

